    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Player bottomed Teferi's Tutelage instead of the redundant Island during scry 2. Teferi's Tutelage has exceptional synergy with Bruvac the Grandiloquent already in hand (every draw would mill opponent for 4 cards). The player already has 3 Islands in hand and doesn't need another land.",
