    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Attempted to cast Bruvac the Grandiloquent but the mana payment failed and the cast was rolled back, wasting the priority window. Additionally, Bruvac's mill-doubling ability is largely irrelevant in this game state with no mill effects available, making it a vanilla 1/4 for 3 mana. Activating Teferi's Protege to loot would have been productive regardless of mana issues.",
