      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed on activating Necromancer's Stockpile during combat with 2 untapped lands (Forest + Swamp) and creature cards in hand. Could have discarded Elvish Rejuvenator to draw a card at instant speed with the opponent fully tapped out. The mana would otherwise go unused since neither Gravedigger (3B) nor Rejuvenator (2G) can be cast with only 2 available mana post-combat.",
