    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed on activating Necromancer's Stockpile to discard Gravedigger (a Zombie) during combat. This would have drawn a card and created a 2/2 Zombie token that would be a 3/3 with Lord of the Accursed's buff, representing significant value. The Gravedigger's recursion target (Reckless Amplimancer) is relatively low-value compared to getting a 3/3 body + card draw immediately.",
