    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Attacking with Bruvac the Grandiloquent risks losing the key mill-doubling legendary creature for just 1 point of damage. The opponent has sick creatures (Elderleaf Mentor 3/2, Elf Warrior 1/1, Zombie Token 3/3) that can block, and a double-block would deal 4 damage to Bruvac's 4 toughness, killing it. While Sweep Away could save it, using a removal spell reactively to protect an unnecessary attack is wasteful.",
